1594 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Designed and owned features across passenger transport and logistics products in Southeast Asia and Japan\056 Mentored up to 3 junior designers and defended design decisions with product\054 engineering and client stakeholders\056\nMixed\055model booking flow\nReworked Kyushu University\220s Ito Campus transit app to add fixed route booking alongside on\055demand\054 supporting a service used by 50\054000\053 riders annually\056\nThe new fixed\055route service saw 80\045\053 repeat usage among dormitory riders within four months of launch\056\nRoute Planning and Dispatch Tool\nDesigned key route planning features\054 including automated order\055to\055vehicle assignment\054 manual assignment changes\054 stop reordering and order splitting\056\nThe tool supports 10\054000\053 daily orders across 6\053 enterprise clients in Singapore\054 Thailand and the Philippines\054 including a major Thai supermarket chain handling 6\054000\053 orders across 1\054000\053 vehicles\056)
