1624 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Designed passenger\055facing booking experiences across three mobility product lines\072 Commute Pass\054 Digital Fixed Routes and On Demand\056\nCommute Pass\nDesigned a recurring employee transport booking flow for regular and rotating shift schedules\054 allowing rides to follow employees\220 work patterns automatically\073 first deployed at Lonza\054 where the wider service supported 700\053 employees daily\056\nAdapted the model for Sembcorp Marine during COVID\054 replacing its monthly pass with shift\055based recurring booking\073 post launch ride booking and management ratings reached 4\0563\0575\056\nDigital Fixed Routes\nLed passenger app design for V1 and V2 of SWAT\220s enterprise shuttle booking product\054 with V2 introducing bulk multi\055day booking so commuters could schedule multiple rides at once\056\nDelivered the Airline House booking experience for Singapore Airlines and SIA Engineering staff\054 with passenger numbers increasing 27\0568\045 monthly in the first three months\056\nOn Demand\nSurfaced Hakuba\220s 10\045 app payment discount at the point of payment\054 supporting a cashless initiative to reduce driver cash handling and paper fare administration\073 cashless booking share increased by 33\045 season over season\056\nExpanded booking to support children and wheelchair users for the first time\073 new passenger types accounted for 19\045 of completed trips within five months\054 with wheelchair trips making up the majority of new type usage\056)
     /K [ 26 ]
     /P 1625 0 R
     /Pg 1572 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

